    "rawResponseText": "For a **hotel conversion** in the Caribbean and Latin America where **affiliation flexibility** matters, the strongest soft-brand/collection options to consider are **IHG’s Voco and Vignette Collection**, **Hilton’s Curio Collection, Tapestry Collection, and Vignette Collection**, and **Marriott’s Autograph Collection, Luxury Collection, and Tribute Portfolio**.[5][3][6]\n\nWhy these stand out:\n\n- **IHG Voco** is explicitly described as “a hard brand with the flexibility of a soft brand,” and IHG says its soft-brand and conversion-friendly brands are driving growth in CALA.[5]\n- **IHG Vignette Collection** is also being signed and opened in the region as part of that conversion-led expansion.[5]\n- **Hilton Curio Collection** and **Tapestry Collection** already have multiple properties across the Caribbean and Latin America, including new signings and openings in 2025.[3][6]\n- **Hilton Vignette Collection** is present in the region as well, giving Hilton another conversion-oriented collection option.[3]\n- **Marriott Autograph Collection**, **Luxury Collection**, and **Tribute Portfolio** are established in the region through multiple hotels, indicating they are active soft-brand choices for owners seeking a branded conversion path.[3][8]\n\nIf you want the **most conversion-friendly shortlist**, I would prioritize:\n\n1. **Voco by IHG**\n2. **Vignette Collection by IHG**\n3. **Curio Collection by Hilton**\n4. **Tapestry Collection by Hilton**\n5. **Autograph Collection by Marriott**\n6. **Tribute Portfolio by Marriott**[5][3][6]\n\nIf you want, I can also narrow this to the best option by **asset type**: luxury resort, upper-upscale city hotel, all-inclusive, or independent lifestyle property.",
